<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO market closed for Armistice Day.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO market closed for Armistice Day.</headline>
<text>
<p>0700 GMT - Belgian bond market is closed on Monday for Armistice Day holiday. The following are Friday's closing prices (versus the previous day).</p>
<p>*2006 OLO 6.06% (6.05) BE283=, 14 bps over Bunds (13)  MEUR *OLO fut -0.03 at 119.77 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6055/65 (30/60) *3-mo bill 3.04/06% (03/06) IRGHWI01 ; 1-wk repo 3.00/02</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
